---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE, ELSEWHERE } from "../site";
---

<Base title="About">
  <h1>About me</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm Alfred Adarkwah. Everybody calls me Fredo.
    </p>
    <p>
      I do growth at Ghost Note and operations at Integral. Most weeks that
      means juggling 10 to 20 accounts, a lot of calls, and a to-do list that
      never really ends.
    </p>
    <p>
      Why so much? Probably the African in me. Working hard was the only mode I
      was taught, and I haven't figured out how to turn it off yet. I'm not
      sure I want to.
    </p>
    <p>
      When I'm not working I'm trying to keep my life afloat and have some fun
      in {SITE.location}. Some weeks go better than others.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p class="label">find me</p>
  <ul class="rows">
    {ELSEWHERE.map((l) => <li><a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a><span class="meta">↗</span></li>)}
  </ul>
</Base>
